{'symbol': 'FISV', 'date': '2021-08-20 14:39:00', 'title': 'CENTRAL 1 REPORTS 2021 SECOND QUARTER FINANCIAL RESULTS', 'text': "VANCOUVER, BRITISH COLUMBIA, AUG. 20, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- CENTRAL 1 CREDIT UNION (‘CENTRAL 1' OR ‘THE ORGANIZATION') REPORTED AN INCREASE IN PROFIT OF $25.6 MILLION FOR THE FIRST HALF OF 2021, COMPARED TO THE SAME PERIOD LAST YEAR. FOR THE SECOND QUARTER (Q2) ENDED JUNE 30, 2021, PROFIT AFTER TAX WAS $3.5 MILLION COMPARED TO A PROFIT OF $39.9 MILLION IN THE SAME PERIOD IN 2020. PRIOR YEAR SECOND QUARTER RESULTS INCLUDED A MATERIAL INCREASE IN NET REALIZED AND UNREALIZED GAINS OF $46.4 MILLION."}